WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.618
Empty sets create an important edge case ANY needs
at least one

00:00:05.644 --> 00:00:11.577
successful comparison If the set is empty no
comparison can succeed

00:00:11.788 --> 00:00:17.361
so ANY is FALSE ALL asks whether every comparison
succeeds

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:24.126
With no values there is no failing comparison so ALL
is TRUE This

00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:29.087
can feel surprising but it follows the logic of
existential and universal conditions
